" ││ Tab/Shift-Tab  Next / previous tab                      PgUp/PgDn      Scroll up / down                         │ │ "
" ││ s              Steer: send the running agent a note     End            Follow the newest                        │ │ "
" ││ p              Pause the build (again to resume)        y              Copy to your terminal's scrollback       │ │ "
" ││ x              Stop the build                           w              Open Toolroll in your browser            │─┤ "
" ││ a              Accept the result                        ?              These keys                               │ │ "
" ││ r              Send back with a note; retry if failed   q              Quit                                     │ │ "
" ││ t              Take over: a terminal on the build       L              Next layout (one, two or four panels)    │ │ "
" ││ n              New task                                 o/O            Next / previous pane                     │ │ "
" ││ T              New thread                               A              Agents: add, sign in, choose models      │ │ "
" ││                                                                                                                 │ │ "
" ││ In Diff                                                                                                         │ │ "
" ││ j/k            Next / previous line                     c              A note on the line or hunk               │ │ "
