" ││ ]/[            Next / previous hunk                     e/E            More lines above / below the hunk        │ │ "
" ││ }/{            Next / previous file                     v              Side by side (a wide window)             │ │ "
" ││ n/N            Next / previous note                                                                             │ │ "
" ││                                                                                                                 │ │ "
" ││ 1-9            Answer the agent's question              Ctrl-]         Leave a terminal you are typing in       │ │ "
